          }
        },
        "review_deborah_b": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Our 4 kids LOVE the taste of these gummies and",
            "body": "<p>Our 4 kids LOVE the taste of these gummies and actually fight over who is going to take their MVIs first every day!</p>",
            "author": "Deborah B.",
            "date": "2026-07-03",
            "verified": true
          }
        },
        "review_thorne": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Proof is in the Gummie.",
            "body": "<p>I am an ex-pro athlete, far removed now, and a single father to 2 teenage young men. Fitness is part of my lifestyle. Nutrition goes hand in hand. My sons, unfortunately, not so much. They will rarely eat a vegetable or fruit. Both are aspiring soccer players. Both have been showing a lack of mental clarity and energy, issues with not sleeping enough or sleeping in way too much, and an overall lack of drive to be active. After both consistently starting a First Day routine, I have seen noticeable differences, and I am purchasing more after I leave this review.</p>",
            "author": "Thorne",
            "date": "2026-06-29",
            "verified": true
          }
        },
        "review_k_lee_a": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "title": "Complete Game Changer!!",
            "body": "<p>I was 100% skeptical and 1000% desperate to help our 13 yo son. First dose I noticed his mood completely shift. Thought I was crazy. Next day even more noticeable.  He was letting me touch him. Grabbing to hold my hand. Laughing.  Being kind, respectful and sweet. He loves the taste so I never have to remind him but more importantly he notices the difference.  I think this should be a must for most moody/anxious kids before you try any medication.  The difference is remarkable.  He wakes up happy. Sleeping better. Just all around better! Worth every penny.</p>",
            "author": "K-Lee A.",
            "date": "2026-06-28",
            "verified": true
          }
        }
      },
